00:03:23.377 --> 00:03:28.097
One Reddit user spent two years building a free Chrome extension that fact checks politicians

00:03:28.097 --> 00:03:28.957
while they speak.

00:03:29.557 --> 00:03:32.577
A Chrome extension is a tiny add-on for the Chrome browser.

00:03:33.137 --> 00:03:38.097
The tool listens to speeches or videos, finds claims that can be checked, searches the

00:03:38.097 --> 00:03:41.997
web for sources, then gives a quick verdict on whether the claim holds up.

00:03:42.477 --> 00:03:47.477
It transcribes the spoken words, picks out those checkable claims, retrieves sources

00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:53.077
through web search, and uses chat GPT to deliver the verdict while avoiding hallucinated sources,

00:03:53.557 --> 00:03:54.957
meaning made up citations.

00:03:55.477 --> 00:04:00.397
It also runs on news sites and social media, so you can use it while scrolling or watching

00:04:00.397 --> 00:04:02.357
