00:04:02.797 --> 00:04:07.497
Install it from the Chrome web store by searching for the Fact Checker project shared in the chat

00:04:07.497 --> 00:04:13.357
GPT community on Reddit. Then try it on a short news video and watch real-time verdicts appear

00:04:13.357 --> 00:04:19.977
